config MR75203
	bool "Moortec MR75203 On-Die PVT Sensor"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MOORTEC_MR75203_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable driver for the Moortec MR75203 Process, Voltage, and
	  Temperature (PVT) monitor used on the T-Head TH1520 SoC.
